{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world\u2019s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BECOME 007</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new standalone, re-imagined James Bond origin story, and the events that lead an audacious young hero to become the best MI6 agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Become_007.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A THRILLING ESPIONAGE ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on missions in breathtaking locations, drive iconic vehicles, and dive into a cinematic adventure in pursuit of a rogue agent who\u2019s always one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/A_Thrilling_Espionage_Adventure.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPYING, YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go silent or go loud. Whether fighting with fists or firepower, using gadgets to infiltrate, or bluffing your way past guards, the approach is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Spying_Your_Way.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WELCOME TO MI6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills and replay your favorite missions with additional modifiers, for endless espionage fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Welcome_to_M16.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768760?t=1751469755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/e8704084c7339af80e412057d6d02972aff81c79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751469755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/244e00f17e6d0b5d1e88320dfbb5a12b483be700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751469755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/244e00f17e6d0b5d1e88320dfbb5a12b483be700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751469755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow James Bond as a young, resourceful and sometimes reckless recruit in MI6's training program, and discover an origin story of the world\u2019s most famous spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a heroic act, young Naval air crewman James Bond is offered to join the newly revived Double 0 program. But when a mission to stop a rogue agent ends in tragedy, he must join forces with his reluctant mentor Greenway to expose a deep conspiracy and stop a looming coup at the heart of the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BECOME 007</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new standalone, re-imagined James Bond origin story, and the events that lead an audacious young hero to become the best MI6 agent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Become_007.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A THRILLING ESPIONAGE ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on missions in breathtaking locations, drive iconic vehicles, and dive into a cinematic adventure in pursuit of a rogue agent who\u2019s always one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/A_Thrilling_Espionage_Adventure.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPYING, YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go silent or go loud. Whether fighting with fists or firepower, using gadgets to infiltrate, or bluffing your way past guards, the approach is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Spying_Your_Way.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WELCOME TO MI6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills and replay your favorite missions with additional modifiers, for endless espionage fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768760/extras/Welcome_to_M16.gif?t=1751469755\" /></div></p>","developers":["IO Interactive A/S"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i